# Built frontend, embedded into the Go binary (internal/webui/webui.go).
# index.html is committed as a placeholder so the module always builds;
# `task web:build` overwrites it with the real build (locally modified,
# never committed) plus the hashed asset files below.
internal/webui/dist/*
!internal/webui/dist/index.html

